    "A bullet list opens right after a paragraph line, with no blank between:\n",
    "\n",
    "- apples\n",
    "- pears\n",
    "\n",
    "An ordered list interrupts the same way:\n",
    "\n",
    "1.  second\n",
    "2.  third\n",
    "\n",
    "A parenthesized or roman marker has a list shape but no enabled style\n",
    "here, so it breaks off as its own plain paragraph rather than folding\n",
    "in:\n",
    "\n",
    "\\(5\\) parenthesized\n",
    "\n",
    "A decimal marker closed by a single paren stays prose and folds in, so\n",
    "these two lines remain one paragraph: 1) not a list 2) still prose"
   ],
